text: |-
  To take my exams using DAC services, I agree to:
  • Submit my DAC accommodations requests, via myDAC,
  for each course that I intend to utilize my implemented
  DAC accommodations within.
  • Schedule each individual quiz or exam of mine a
  minimum of 3 business days in advance to ensure
  sufficient staffing levels.
  • Schedule each individual Final Exam of mine a no later
  than the last day to withdraw from a class to ensure
  sufficient staffing levels and IN ACCORDANCE with the
  Registrar's Final Exams Schedule.
  • Schedule all of my quizzes and exams for the correct
  dates and times as listed within the parameters of each
  of my instructor's completed course Alternative Testing
  Agreements.
  • Arrive on time at the DAC Testing Center on the day and
  exact time I scheduled the exam/quiz
  • Conduct myself professionally and respectfully at all
  times.
  When taking exams, I agree to:
  • Monitor my own testing time and submit my
  quizzes/exams before the calculated time has expired.
  • Check my exams and notify testing staff immediately if
  there is a problem with the exam (extended testing time
  is not applied, wrong test, missing/incorrect number of
  pages, etc.).
  • Refrain from discussing the exam with any other
  students in the class.
  • Not cheat. I understand that I will be held accountable to
  the University's Code of Conduct.
